00:08:15,652 --> 00:08:21,652
Paddington is a comedy, adventure, family film directed by Paul King.

3
00:12:23,478 --> 00:12:29,478
A young Peruvian bear travels to London in search of a home.

4
00:16:31,304 --> 00:16:37,304
Finding himself lost and alone at Paddington Station, he meets the
kindly Brown family, who offer him a temporary haven.

5
00:20:39,130 --> 00:20:45,130
Paddington (voice), played by Ben Whishaw.

6
